A reminder - Clear limits on delegated tasks can help researchers assess the results of agent workflows. Harnessing AI Agents for Reliable Research is a seminar livestreaming November 4 with Hadi Fariborzi (Bissett School of Business, Mount Royal University, Calgary). Use output contracts and decision logs to keep AI agent work readable and open to inspection. Researchers analyzing ecological and environmental data in R can adapt these practices to document their analytical decisions. The worked example also shows how to check a quantitative pipeline against validation criteria.

